    <item>
      <title>RasanAI Studio 0.11.0 beta 1</title>
      <pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 16:05:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[- **Liquid Glass chrome.** The inspector, action bar and step capsule use the sidebar's own Liquid Glass; the stage no longer lights it.
- **Pause freezes the film in place.** Nothing runs and no tokens are used; Resume carries on mid-step with nothing redone.
- **The Mac stays awake while a film is made,** a setting on by default.
- **Carries on after sleep,** and an automatic resume that came due while asleep runs on wake.
- **The brief box grows to 12 lines, then scrolls,** instead of spilling over the page.]]></description>
      <sparkle:version>28</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.11.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/Sibhimanyu/rasanai/releases/download/studio-v0.11.0-beta.1/RasanAI-Studio-0.11.0.dmg" sparkle:edSignature="1JYrbo/YtxiveecUb6tq+KHELIZgj3xosh8vyVbCwmPu8/vslU8fi0l5qZHE2iabykqRCIFCPQuCDRgCU19zBQ==" length="74947934" type="application/octet-stream" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>RasanAI Studio 0.10.0 beta 1</title>
      <pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 10:30:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[- **Glass that takes its light from the stage.** The inspector and action bar glow with the frame's edge colour, live while the film plays; the glass is solid and untinted.
- **Install Claude Code or Codex inside Studio,** with progress in the window; Terminal opens only for sign-in.
- **A sidebar that shows where you are.** Icons for each place, Queue in the one group, and recent films with a mark for their state.
- **Suggested titles follow the brief,** and never replace a name you typed.
- **The film page names the running agent,** and review notes can be skipped before Apply.
- **A steadier opening and plainer words,** and clicking a film card opens it again.]]></description>
      <sparkle:version>27</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.10.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/Sibhimanyu/rasanai/releases/download/studio-v0.10.0-beta.1/RasanAI-Studio-0.10.0.dmg" sparkle:edSignature="KPNW8h9xkr9Fq1IqMOn0nQg24EnuaY+vBW88sK20SuMnF16gVOQRZadYN6bEABWYMTeWkjLkNQPlpqfySH4dAg==" length="74830519" type="application/octet-stream" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>RasanAI Studio 0.9.0 beta 1</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 16:25:05 GMT</pubDate>
      <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[- **Liquid Glass, built for real.** Studio is built against the current macOS SDK, so macOS Tahoe draws its glass chrome itself.
- **A native sidebar app.** A system split view with the glass sidebar, which folds and opens with the system animation; folded, the toggle moves into the top bar.
- **A proper toolbar.** Back and forward, a glass capsule search, a blue New film button and plain white ••• menus, with no toolbar band in full screen.
- **The film page is an editor workspace,** with notes in a right inspector and one status bar for each stage's actions; its main button has no Return shortcut.
- **New film uses the whole window,** with compact four-across format tiles, and the move viewer fits its video.]]></description>
      <sparkle:version>26</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.9.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/Sibhimanyu/rasanai/releases/download/studio-v0.9.0-beta.1/RasanAI-Studio-0.9.0.dmg" sparkle:edSignature="P7J5Ces4M52dQaRVlyPHiZVj/7Qcahds/cvICRIRKTAKxfNxJPoC6NMlqok1iNt5Fvzg7UeIm2lZH7OEIVqwAw==" length="74499006" type="application/octet-stream" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>RasanAI Studio 0.8.2 beta 1</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 08:51:24 GMT</pubDate>
      <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[- **A calmer, more professional finish.** New film is the one loud action on Home, the Home toolbar is icon-only with tooltips, and Story and Look name Claude's pick once, on the option.
- **New film footer is one row,** with one secondary button style for Use template, Save as template, Save draft and Discard.
- **Footage folder copy fixed.** The footage well now says "Drop a folder of clips" instead of the brand-kit prompt.
- **Reopening at launch** returns to the last film only if you quit on a film page; otherwise Studio opens on Home.]]></description>
      <sparkle:version>25</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.8.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/Sibhimanyu/rasanai/releases/download/studio-v0.8.2-beta.1/RasanAI-Studio-0.8.2.dmg" sparkle:edSignature="I1YJpPK1a4Ja7oiaBaH5wtwp69a/LuCgjCcOPmD0tcNNXimKrvlP1zWVh2k0aVwgZXwJk6USVwjZEpnj9eXhCw==" length="74280068" type="application/octet-stream" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>RasanAI Studio 0.8.1 beta 1</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 06:40:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[- **Move viewer sound fixed.** The expanded viewer could play a clip twice a few frames apart (an echo) and pause stopped only one copy. There is now one player: one sound, and pause always stops it.
- **Silent clips say so.** The viewer shows "No sound in this clip" instead of a mute button that does nothing.]]></description>
      <sparkle:version>24</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.8.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/Sibhimanyu/rasanai/releases/download/studio-v0.8.1-beta.1/RasanAI-Studio-0.8.1.dmg" sparkle:edSignature="ExmKxH9zf7fptRTDipZT4nNdXH8A9uAZszvt6U7iOD/k810CFZg4HEDG15UwFyAp3hcnHKWNZKSWr5oUZRpDDw==" length="74272169" type="application/octet-stream" />
