    <item>
      <title>RasanAI Studio 0.8.0 beta 1</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 04:42:23 GMT</pubDate>
      <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[- **Moves I like.** The Hook / Proof / Turn / Call to action slots are gone: pick up to four moves by taste, each with an optional place, and Claude puts them on the story's beats.
- **Expanded moves with sound.** Click a move to watch it large with its audio, with technique filters.
- **Moves on the style frames**, with Swap.
- **A format picker** ("What are you making?"), notifications when a call is ready, Needs you first on Home, and folder sources.
- **A cleaner composer** with a bottom toolbar.
- Bundles RasanAI 1.14.0.]]></description>
      <sparkle:version>23</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.8.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/Sibhimanyu/rasanai/releases/download/studio-v0.8.0-beta.1/RasanAI-Studio-0.8.0.dmg" sparkle:edSignature="EYIFRU4Jes0IGc/cxroqvCut0bQ+Bvc98OCUeoP7lSS/PW1XrQ8wnImDaEKUVXKyLwbwakxsehJY0eWoQ1JbAQ==" length="74263295" type="application/octet-stream" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>RasanAI Studio 0.7.0 beta 1</title>
      <pubDate>Sat, 10 Oct 2026 04:05:17 GMT</pubDate>
      <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[- **Films that keep moving.** Short films are written by one builder and checked frame by frame before you see them; one feature and one scenario per launch film; a faster tempo; real logo files only.
- **Get inspired:** a credited gallery of real launch-film moments to start a film from.
- **One status line** says whose move it is; the toolbar shows only tokens and cost.
- **The Story step** shows what each story achieves.
- Fixes: nothing says it is waiting on you after you answer; the running film no longer asks you to stop the director.]]></description>
      <sparkle:version>22</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.7.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/Sibhimanyu/rasanai/releases/download/studio-v0.7.0-beta.1/RasanAI-Studio-0.7.0.dmg" sparkle:edSignature="by+XpMPao4VhSv8RS+jlld1nbMQAW4W45YJf+pB8L6X2X9+94p/4qq24G6moJ/Z6zosO+ZjUKT0GfsFw5y2TDQ==" length="71177913" type="application/octet-stream" />
