    <item>
      <title>RasanAI Studio 0.6.4 beta 1</title>
      <pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 12:10:13 GMT</pubDate>
      <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[- **No more flickering text on hover.** Cards and tiles no longer lift, scale or fade their text on hover.
- **Scene strip:** chips no longer overlap in a narrow player.
- **Decisions inspector** runs the full window height.
- **Cursor:** clicking part of the brief no longer leaves the hand cursor stuck.
- **Elapsed time** past an hour reads h:mm:ss.]]></description>
